    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/3c38c922b52134a6ef70d11f0a626406.poster.avif?t=1751448509\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/3c38c922b52134a6ef70d11f0a626406.webm?t=1751448509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/3c38c922b52134a6ef70d11f0a626406.mp4?t=1751448509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore mysterious architectural spaces with oppressive, liminal atmospheres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/b453ba55beb49883191f3b65fb892fba.poster.avif?t=1751448509\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/b453ba55beb49883191f3b65fb892fba.webm?t=1751448509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/b453ba55beb49883191f3b65fb892fba.mp4?t=1751448509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete mini-game tasks to uncover fragmented clues about other players\u2019 identities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/364dbfd543f0cac7a339624887a70d5a.poster.avif?t=1751448509\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/364dbfd543f0cac7a339624887a70d5a.webm?t=1751448509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/364dbfd543f0cac7a339624887a70d5a.mp4?t=1751448509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access system terminals to retrieve vague intel about other players\u2019 identities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/cd9bf48bd47dda7f234d768f2151748e.poster.avif?t=1751448509\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/cd9bf48bd47dda7f234d768f2151748e.webm?t=1751448509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/cd9bf48bd47dda7f234d768f2151748e.mp4?t=1751448509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choices based on clues to speculate about your own or others\u2019 true identities: Who are you? Who are they?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/9780aa5c2900a1aaae2555530da8d5d7.poster.avif?t=1751448509\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/9780aa5c2900a1aaae2555530da8d5d7.webm?t=1751448509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/9780aa5c2900a1aaae2555530da8d5d7.mp4?t=1751448509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can successfully identify someone, you can eliminate them, but stay sharp: you might be next.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/3c38c922b52134a6ef70d11f0a626406.poster.avif?t=1751448509\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/3c38c922b52134a6ef70d11f0a626406.webm?t=1751448509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/3c38c922b52134a6ef70d11f0a626406.mp4?t=1751448509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore mysterious architectural spaces with oppressive, liminal atmospheres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/b453ba55beb49883191f3b65fb892fba.poster.avif?t=1751448509\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/b453ba55beb49883191f3b65fb892fba.webm?t=1751448509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/b453ba55beb49883191f3b65fb892fba.mp4?t=1751448509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete mini-game tasks to uncover fragmented clues about other players\u2019 identities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/364dbfd543f0cac7a339624887a70d5a.poster.avif?t=1751448509\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/364dbfd543f0cac7a339624887a70d5a.webm?t=1751448509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/364dbfd543f0cac7a339624887a70d5a.mp4?t=1751448509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access system terminals to retrieve vague intel about other players\u2019 identities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/cd9bf48bd47dda7f234d768f2151748e.poster.avif?t=1751448509\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/cd9bf48bd47dda7f234d768f2151748e.webm?t=1751448509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/cd9bf48bd47dda7f234d768f2151748e.mp4?t=1751448509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choices based on clues to speculate about your own or others\u2019 true identities: Who are you? Who are they?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/9780aa5c2900a1aaae2555530da8d5d7.poster.avif?t=1751448509\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/9780aa5c2900a1aaae2555530da8d5d7.webm?t=1751448509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/9780aa5c2900a1aaae2555530da8d5d7.mp4?t=1751448509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can successfully identify someone, you can eliminate them, but stay sharp: you might be next.</p>",
    "short_description": "8 test subjects are trapped in a sealed building, controlled by a mysterious system. Each has a hidden codename that determines both their win condition and threat level. Complete tasks to gain clues and eliminate others by deducing their codename. Uncover your own, or survive to the end to escape.",
